[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4201.75, "timestamp": "01:10:01", "text": "因为我不知道如何用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4205.669, "timestamp": "01:10:05", "text": "这个模型或其他什么东西正确地制作内容，就让它在一周后就销声匿迹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4209.27, "timestamp": "01:10:09", "text": "。 我会非常难过。 我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4213.27, "timestamp": "01:10:13", "text": "想，我兼职工作了那么多年，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4216.149, "timestamp": "01:10:16", "text": "日夜操劳，付出了那么多心血和汗水，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4219.35, "timestamp": "01:10:19", "text": "才还清了这瓶酒、驾照"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4221.99, "timestamp": "01:10:21", "text": "等等所有费用，结果就给我这个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4224.229, "timestamp": "01:10:24", "text": "我也会那样。  [笑声] 我会像这样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4228.063, "timestamp": "01:10:28", "text": "我会像这样，大声抱怨这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4234.87, "timestamp": "01:10:34", "text": "Z：所以我就想，好吧，我会慢慢来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4237.43, "timestamp": "01:10:37", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4240.63, "timestamp": "01:10:40", "text": "冻僵也很糟糕，不过，我会慢慢来"}]